-- Cement plants come back.
--
-- 0038_remove_construction_materials.sql, as first applied to production on 2026-11-18, matched NAICS '3273%'.
-- That is the whole group "cement and concrete products", so along with ready-mix, block, pipe and precast it
-- took the cement plants themselves (32731), which make a product in a kiln and are manufacturing by any reading.
-- 0038 now names only the concrete codes; this puts back what it should not have taken: 41 cement plants,
-- the companies that were removed with them, and their registry references, exactly as they were (same ids),
-- read from the restore point taken before 0038. Rows tagged 32731 that are plainly concrete yards or cement
-- terminals are left out.
--
-- Safe to repeat: a row that is already there is left alone.

